                <mxCell id="tidy_principle_box" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F8F5;strokeColor=#17A589;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=8;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#17A589&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tidy data principles satisfied:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2C3E50&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;1. Each variable (Department, Month, Budget Amount) has its own column.&lt;br&gt;2. Each observation (one department in one month) has its own row.&lt;br&gt;3. This single table holds one type of observational unit (monthly budgets).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
